# Auto Export Demo — project context

This is an MVP Telegram bot for auto export document workflow.

Main goal:
- Telegram bot receives documents from a private Telegram group.
- Bot saves original files to Yandex Disk.
- Bot stores metadata and extracted document fields in PostgreSQL.
- Bot sends files/text to OCR/LLM workflow.
- Bot checks consistency between documents:
  - VIN
  - contract number
  - customer passport data
  - amount
  - currency
  - HS code
  - net weight
  - gross weight
  - vehicle model
- Bot replies to Telegram group with validation results.

Architecture:
- Backend: Python
- Telegram bot: aiogram or python-telegram-bot
- Database: PostgreSQL on Railway
- Storage: Yandex Disk
- OCR/LLM: Yandex AI Studio / Yandex Cloud
- Deploy: Railway

Important:
- Do not hardcode secrets.
- Use environment variables.
- Keep code simple for MVP.
- Prefer small modules and clear functions.
- First priority is working file intake from Telegram to Yandex Disk and PostgreSQL.